{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1477686-anima-aeon-future-of-russia","id":1477686,"title":"[Anima/Aeon] Future of Russia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-03-30T08:44:48-07:00","id":1477686,"title":"[Anima/Aeon] Future of Russia","content":"Both <b>Anima</b> and <b>Aeon</b> corebooks point to the future of great superpowers on Earth in 21st and 22nd century. However, it strangely lack the future of Russia - country ( or federation ) we can point as 3rd world power, after USA and China, in real life.<br /> <b>So what do you think is now status of Russia in 2080s ( Anima ) and 2120s ( Aeon ) in Trinity Continuum?</b><br /> <br /> We probably will not miss now Russian-Ukraine 2022 war, so let's just be civil about it.<br /> <br /> <b>My take</b> - I think that in <b>Trinity</b>, Russia lose war to Ukraine, after mass support of Western countries. Russian Federation ( RF ) has used up resources and the economy is collapsing. Within two decades, Russia is transforming from a superpower to a satellite country of China. In the 2050s, RF is de facto part of China Protectorate, stretching on whole Asia. <b>Russia still remains nominally independent</b> - but by the <b>Anima <i>2080s</i></b><i> it is practically annexed</i>. Still, culturally, the government in Moscow claims 'Great Russia' - when after 50 years of cultural influence from China - it is more like a distant Chinese province in Europe.<br /> <br /> In <b>Aeon</b>'s 2120s, Russia is 'weird Slavic province' of China.<br /> <br /> I base this on those articles:<br /> <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/russia-failure-china-gain-ukraine-nato-geopolitical-competition-cold-war-allies-beijing-invasion-expansion-war-11646834842\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.wsj.com/articles/russia-...ar-11646834842</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-war-in-ukraine-could-put-russia-deeper-in-chinas-pocket-than-ever-what/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.theglobeandmail.com/worl...han-ever-what/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-16-2022, 04:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T09:16:32-07:00","id":1477688,"title":"","content":"The war in Ukraine may have never happened, the world in Trinity Continuim is not ours. Also Russia is covered in Abberant and in Terra Firma","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T17:56:17-07:00","id":1477718,"title":"","content":"I'm all for interesting projections into the future of a setting, but given the sensitivity of the Ukraine/Russian war - I'm thinking now might not be the best time to be including it. Think of how the US felt about 9/11 and consider that people are still dying right now. It's not a going to be a good subject for fantasising about publicly for a while.<br /> <br /> My suggestions, either remove the conflict from the timeline you're discussing or leave the subject be for a while.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26905-eternl-knight","name":"Eternl Knight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26905_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T18:29:33-07:00","id":1477722,"title":"","content":"Or you know, a Nova removed a certain some ones tonsils through thier anus...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T18:30:30-07:00","id":1477723,"title":"","content":"Agreed. There's no mention of a Russia/Ukraine War in the main Trinity Continuum timeline; not does there need to be. I'll have to double-check; but I'm pretty sure that real-world politics <i>in general</i> don't make an appearance. TC isn't \u201cour world, but with\u2026\u201d the way the World of Darkness is \u201cour world, but with monsters\u201d; it's an alternate world that diverged from real-world history over a century ago, possibly earlier. For instance, there's no indication of who the Presidents of the United States have been; if you wish, you could easily say that, e.g., there was never a Trump presidency, and there would be nothing in the published material to contradict you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T20:34:29-07:00","id":1477739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1477686-anima-aeon-future-of-russia?p=1477723#post1477723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed. There's no mention of a Russia/Ukraine War in the main Trinity Continuum timeline; not does there need to be. I'll have to double-check; but I'm pretty sure that real-world politics <i>in general</i> don't make an appearance. TC isn't \u201cour world, but with\u2026\u201d the way the World of Darkness is \u201cour world, but with monsters\u201d; it's an alternate world that diverged from real-world history over a century ago, possibly earlier. For instance, there's no indication of who the Presidents of the United States have been; if you wish, you could easily say that, e.g., there was never a Trump presidency, and there would be nothing in the published material to contradict you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Earlier than a hundred years ago, as Trinity Aether is going to involve a invasion by freaking aliens in tripods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-30T20:47:05-07:00","id":1477741,"title":"","content":"That's why I said \u201c<i>over</i> a century ago\u201d, yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-31T21:04:21-07:00","id":1477828,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">As a matter of respect for the ongoing crisis, can we keep this primarily focused on the future setting versus existing issues facing the countries involved.</span></b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T15:19:38-07:00","id":1495195,"title":"","content":"i made Putin a Nova of immense intelligence and some stamina to keep him going a bit longer considering hes 70 now. Basically a Political master with a subpar military but vast natural resources.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27624-logansrun68","name":"logansrun68","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T04:05:32-07:00","id":1495231,"title":"","content":"I made canon in my games that Russia lose war in Ukraine on 9th May of 2024 - being humiliated in day of their greatest national holiday. And then China takes over the role of leading Empire of East...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T12:06:44-07:00","id":1495261,"title":"","content":"It really doesn't look good for either Russia or China. They both have extremely unhealthy demographics. The idea of either nation as a dominant power in the 2120s is unlikely. Indonesia looks like a far better bet for an Asian superpower. They have the population, resources, and defensible geography. <br /> <br /> As to Russia. They might be a Ukrainian client state in 2120. <br /> <br /> I'm going on demography for my assertions. Germany, which I have far more respect for, is in an equally bad fix. As are the Italians. <br /> <br /> Maybe you should drop the space station on some other nation and let France run Europe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-19T13:26:42-07:00","id":1495265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1477686-anima-aeon-future-of-russia?p=1495261#post1495261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It really doesn't look good for either Russia or China. They both have extremely unhealthy demographics. The idea of either nation as a dominant power in the 2120s is unlikely.</div> </div> </div> </div>China is canonically a major power in Aeon, although that is due to some very specific circumstances. After N-Day they publicly rebranded themselves as benevolent global do-gooders, blaming their bad reputation on the previous administration. This is likely the result of the Bodhisattva, a Chinese child nova with mega mental/social stats who slowly transformed China's system of laws into a super science construct that gave China the most efficient and least corrupt system of government in the world. Given the nature of nova inventions, nobody in the Chinese government dares mess with these laws, since the entire thing is likely to break and can't be fixed by a non-nova.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-02T06:59:35-07:00","id":1496105,"title":"","content":"I think any mention of Russia is inappropriate now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27659-cybergirl","name":"Cybergirl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27659_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-02T08:16:23-07:00","id":1496108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cybergirl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1477686-anima-aeon-future-of-russia?p=1496105#post1496105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think any mention of Russia is inappropriate now.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m inclined to agree with you. The wounds are just too fresh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-02T11:22:14-07:00","id":1496115,"title":"","content":"Also, we have the fate of Russia and basically every conuntry already written for Anima and Aeon, as everything after 2018 is different from our reality in every ways.<br /> <br /> In Aberrant and latter settings there was no COVID, no Ukraine war, nothing like that, just because all that happened after Novas show up changing everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-02T17:26:46-07:00","id":1496140,"title":"","content":"I get it - you do not want to talk about a war. But you do not need to beat it over and over again. <b>Trinity</b> is CONTINUUM, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1468693-tc-assasins-instead-aberrant-on-timeline?p=1493353#post1493353\">there are more timelines than official one</a>, it's main design of 2E multi-setting as we are reminded by developers. You could also simply NOT WRITE IN THIS TOPIC you do not want war. We all do not wanted it if we can.<br /> <br /> I live 100 km from Ukraine boarder. Whole March this year, I was literally afraid that next morning we can have Russian army at our door step. I have one coworker that is Ukrainian. Last month I was wondering if they will send nuclear missiles on us. ( So I dwell into <b>Fallout</b> games lore, in free time. ) I also lived through COVID, hospital, and sickness lingering so much for 1.5 year now, I have proper astma ( beside other complications). Whole package.<br /> <br /> And I STILL want talk about timeline where Russian war happened and COVID happened. Why, you ask? Because, in the end, <b>Trinity is about <i>Hope</i></b>. It literally giving me semblance of light on everyday, envisioning that war will end in 2024. That in next decades, scientific advancement will let people like me to be cured from COVID inflicted problems. That there is <b><i>HOPE </i></b>in this dark times and I can plan things <i>after</i> this war. And I do not need Nova super people to save us - only that we will solve conflict, in next 18 months. I really believe that.<br /> <br /> And all of you saying <i>'we cannot talk about that'</i> - is robbing me and a like people from day to day Hope to live literally 100 km from war.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, I prepare game on timeline just one year after Ukraine wins the war and Russia is globally humiliated. It will be bloody <b>Assassins</b> game - but it also give me hope that war can end relatively quickly. Which I wish for all of us.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://i.imgflip.com/2077oq.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgflip.com/2077oq.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-03-2022, 02:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}